# B1-CELLS.genome — A0, THE CELLS (B1-PREREG.md §4's table, first row).
#
# = genome/ALPHA4.genome with every line that reaches outside the cells, their episodes and their sleep
# REMOVED (the doors, the hands, the mouth, the think thread, the world, the body) — §4's own words. Built
# by Claude (Sonnet 5, B1 builder 2), 2026-09-24, via the empirical parse-and-fix loop the PREREG's own
# advisor review recommended: start from ALPHA4.genome, remove every line outside the cells/episodes/sleep,
# then let genome.machinery.parse_genome's own required-field list (and Organism's own construction) say
# which lines the parser needs kept whole. Nothing here is retyped from memory — every kept line is
# ALPHA4.genome's own line, byte for byte (comments trimmed of ALPHA4-specific cross-references that no
# longer apply once the removed genes are gone).
#
# REMOVED, by category (ALPHA4.genome's own line, for the record — never silently dropped):
#   BODY, TAPE, HEART, CRASH                    — the body/service layer (no body in B1, no threads, no crash policy)
#   SURPRISE, DELIVER                            — the mind's own expected-glance residual wiring (_consume_eye);
#                                                   A0 calls Organism.moment() directly on cached glances, never
#                                                   through the body's SURPRISE-wired _consume_eye path
#   SENSE body, SENSE ear-sound, SENSE smell, SENSE touch, SENSE read shelf, SENSE grade — senses the toy has none of
#   #OFF BIND, #OFF TRAITS, #OFF (the RETINA/SCAN alternatives) — already off in ALPHA4.genome; kept off
#   PREDICT, CURIOSITY, PARK, SELF               — the mind's own modulation/attention/metacognition layer
#   INDUCE, DEDUCE, BELIEF, THINK                — the thinking THREAD (§4's table: A0 answers relation cues
#                                                   with NOTHING, "no road" — it has no thinking organ)
#   EXAM, SIT                                    — the mind's own self-exam duty (B1 grades through its OWN harness)
#   SENTENCE, MOUTH, QUESTION                    — the mouth / question-asking machinery (the world's speech)
#   WORLD (both lines), HANDS, ACT, OUTCOME       — the body's world/hands (B1's world is the harness's tape)
#   DOOR lexicon, DOOR web                        — the mentorship doors
#   GROW's paired CYCLE line is KEPT (below) — consolidation is part of the cells' own machinery, not the body
#   EVOLVE                                        — the genome-mutation duty (a live-body mechanism)
#
# KEPT (every line below is ALPHA4.genome's own text for that gene):
SEED     20260923
SENSE    eye    32x32 grey
RETINA   thresh0.25 centre tower:eye-tower-g2 sqrt unit
GAZE     surprise fixations 4 grid 16 canvas 128 glance 32 ink border coarse 32
